{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14278","headline":"东山月下怀友人 · 窦羣","name":"东山月下怀友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东山多乔木，月午始苍苍。\n虽殊碧海状，爱此青苔光。\n高下灭华烛，参差啓洞房。\n佳人梦余思，宝瑟愁应商。\n皎洁殊未已，沈吟限一方。\n宦情哂鸡口，世路倦羊肠。\n彼美金石分，眷言兰桂芳。\n清晖讵同夕，耿耿但相望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦羣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}